# format_note : This header is parsed as YAML after all leading whitespace is stripped, so keep every entry on one line and avoid apostrophes
# name : LRIS-2 B1250p1 grating efficiency
# description : Efficiency of the B1250p1 grating assembly for the LRIS-2 blue arm
# author : BPH
# source : LRIS2_ETC data/throughput/B1250p1_grating.csv, copied here as code/B1250p1_grating.csv
# date_created : 2026-10-21
# date_modified : 2026-10-21
# status : grating efficiency from the PDR efficiency spreadsheets, via the LRIS-2 ETC
# type : grating:transmission
# action : transmission
# wavelength_unit : um
# notes :
# - transmission = DE x PRISMS, the grating diffraction efficiency times the prism transmission.
# - GRATING ASSEMBLY ONLY. Excludes the telescope, ADC, collimator, dichroic, camera and
# - detector QE, all of which are applied separately.
# - Data cover 0.310 to 0.560 um. One zero point is added just outside each end so the
# - curve is zero beyond the data rather than extrapolated.
# - The curve spans the whole blue arm, but this grating only reaches part of it. LRIS2_ETC
# - limits it to 0.307-0.439 um. Here the wavelength range must come from the
# - spectral trace, which does not exist yet for this grating.
# changes :
# - 2026-10-21 (BPH) created from B1250p1_grating.csv, nm to um
#
